#. <CLT 23>そのプレゼントは渡す事ができません。<CLT>
#. <CLT 3>“重要アイテム”<CLT><CLT 23>ですので…<CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Sorry, but we can't let you give her that. It's what\n"
"we in the industry like to call a<CLT> <CLT 3>key item<CLT><CLT 23>.<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>渡すプレゼントを選択してくださいませ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>What would you like to give her?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 何コレ！　イカす！
msgctxt "0003 | GENOCIDER SHOU"
msgid "What the!? You sure!?"
msgstr ""

#. ゲラゲラゲラゲラ！
#. ありがたく頂いちゃいまーす！！
msgctxt "0004 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Kyeeehahaha! I'd be happy to take it off your hands!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>少しは喜んでくれたかな…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Does that mean she liked it...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. やだ…急にプレゼントなんて…
msgctxt "0006 | GENOCIDER SHOU"
msgid "A present out of nowhere...? Ahhhh~!"
msgstr ""

#. アタシ…キュンとしちゃった…
msgctxt "0007 | GENOCIDER SHOU"
msgid "I'm gettin' all flustered!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>良かった。
#. どうやら喜んでくれたみたいだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I get the impression that she liked it. That's good...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. あらら、素敵…舐めてもいい？
msgctxt "0009 | GENOCIDER SHOU"
msgid "Oh my! It's so wonderful...! Can I lick it!?"
msgstr ""

#. ほら、素敵なモノって舐めたくなるじゃない？
#. アタシだけ？
msgctxt "0010 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"When you get something this nice, don't you just love\n"
"to lick it!? Or is that just me...?"
msgstr ""

#. うほっ！　くれるの！？　マジで！？
msgctxt "0011 | GENOCIDER SHOU"
msgid "Uwah! You're giving this to me? For really real!?"
msgstr ""

#. ヤベーっす！　テンション上がりまくりっす！！
msgctxt "0012 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Ohhh man! I'm gettin' excited like whoa here!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ここまで喜んでもらえると、
#. あげたこっちも嬉しくなるよな…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0013 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Seeing Genocide Jack so pleased with something I gave\n"
"her makes me happy! ...I guess.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. アンタのセンスにはぶったまげだよ…
msgctxt "0014 | GENOCIDER SHOU"
msgid "This just brought me back to my senses..."
msgstr ""

#. このアタシが、そんな物で喜ぶ訳ねーだろッ！！
msgctxt "0015 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Who'd ever be happy with crappy junk crap like this!?"
msgstr ""

#. く、くれるの…アタシに…？
msgctxt "0016 | GENOCIDER SHOU"
msgid "Th-This is for me...? Oh, my..."
msgstr ""

#. …って誰がいるか、ボケ！！
#. もっとマシな物よこせ、クズ！！
msgctxt "0017 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"Bleurgh! Who'd ever say that about THIS, idiot!? Give\n"
"me something better, human garbage!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>しまった…
#. がっかりさせちゃったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0018 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Uh-oh... I don't think she was too happy with that...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. さては、それって…
msgctxt "0019 | GENOCIDER SHOU"
msgid "Hey, is this...?"
msgstr ""

#. プレゼントに見せかけた爆弾だな！
#. それで、アタシを暗殺しようと企んでいるな！！
msgctxt "0020 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"It's a bomb disguised as a present! You're working\n"
"with everyone else to try and kill me!"
msgstr ""

#. 返り討ちにしてやんぞ、コラァ！！
msgctxt "0021 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Well allow me to return the favor, ya bastard!"
msgstr ""

#. ゲラゲラゲラゲラ！
msgctxt "0022 | GENOCIDER SHOU"
msgid "Kyeeehahahahaha!"
msgstr ""

#. …笑ってる内に、その汚物を引っ込めろ。
msgctxt "0023 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"You've got till I'm done laughing to get rid of that\n"
"filth!"
msgstr ""

#. ゲラゲラゲラゲラ！
msgctxt "0024 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Kyeeehahahahaha!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>怒らせちゃったみたいだ…
#. 印象が悪くなっちゃったな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0025 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I...think I made her mad. She probably thinks worse of\n"
"me now...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. やっぱり渡す
msgctxt "0026 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Maybe not..."
msgstr ""

#. 渡さない
msgctxt "0027 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yeah, I'm sure"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>プレゼントを渡さなくてもよろしいですか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0028 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Are you sure you don't want to give her something?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
